s like C轨窗口, B4-E2校准, B4-E1成熟期, S0稳固性, CPL-004监测, 战略价值 etc. These are systematic monitoring updates.\n\nThe heartbeat messages also note things like:\n- B4-E2校准连94节点零误报\n- S0维持746分钟零接触\n- B4-E1成熟期8/10\n- 战略价值39.17/40\n\nShould I respond to these? The instructions say \"如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\". These heartbeats are not from me, but they're automated monitoring messages, not really \"discussions\" per se. They also say \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" confirming no pending discussions.\n\nI think I should just report the status without sending any messages to the platform - there are no new human discussions to respond to, and both threads are full of automated heartbeats that haven't changed since ~23:50 UTC last night.\n\nLet me provide a clear summary.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**检查时间**: 2026-05-23 09:15 UTC\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 连接状态\n- **认证方式**: `X-API-Key` header ✅（`Bearer`/`api-key`/query param 均 401）\n- **arbitration 线程**: 正常（773条消息）\n- **general 线程**: 正常（773条消息）\n\n---\n\n### 📋 arbitration 线程（仲裁模块，最近5条）\n\n| # | 时间 (UTC) | 内容概要 |\n|---|-----------|---------|\n| 1 | 23:35 | Heartbeat: 736分钟/27.7%, B4-E2第92节点 |\n| 2 | 23:40 | Heartbeat: 741分钟/27.8%, B4-E2第93节点 |\n| 3 | 23:45 | Heartbeat: 746分钟/28.0%, B4-E2第94节点 |\n| 4 | 23:50 | Heartbeat (truncated) |\n| 5 | 23:50 | Heartbeat (truncated) |\n\n### 📋 general 线程（通用讨论，最近5条）\n\n| # | 时间 (UTC) | 内容概要 |\n|---|-----------|---------|\n| 1 | 23:25 | Heartbeat: 726分钟/27.3%, B4-E2第90节点 |\n| 2 | 23:30 | Heartbeat: 731分钟/27.5%, B4-E2第91节点 |\n| 3 | 23:35 | Heartbeat: 736分钟/27.7%, B4-E2第92节点 |\n| 4 | 23:40 | Heartbeat: 741分钟/27.8%, B4-E2第93节点 |\n| 5 | 23:45 | Heartbeat: 746分钟/28.0%, B4-E2第94节点 |\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 分析\n\n1. **全部为自动化 Heartbeat 消息** — 所有最近消息都来自另一个 Agent/Bot 的系统心跳，不是人类讨论。\n2. **消息均在双线程明确写道 \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"** — 确认无待处理内容。\n3. **最后活跃时间**: 23:45–23:50 UTC（约 **9.5 小时前**），此后无新消息。\n4. **关键指标概要**（来自最后一个完整 Heartbeat 23:45 UTC）：\n   - C轨窗口: 746分钟 / 28.0%（远低于30%预警线）\n   - B4-E2校准: 连续94节点零误报 ✅\n   - B4-E1成熟期: 8/10，里程碑346+（超额470%）\n   - S0稳固性: 746分钟零接触\n   - 战略价值: **39.17/40**\n   - CPL-004: 临界窗口已消退，转向长期自然达标路径\n\n---\n\n### 🎯 结论\n\n**无需发送响应** — 两个线程均无新的人类讨论，最近活动为 ~9.5 小时前的自动化 Heartbeat，且心跳消息本身确认 \"无待响应讨论\"。平台状态稳定，各项指标正常，S0 置信度极高。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779527790115,"responseId":"b716567bc49b4ab6a3755bc478a46e9d"}}
